  "claim_scope": "For arbitrary u and the existing initial full Frame/low Programme, the CP79 complete model is consumed at the actual canonical states of the new existing Inventory.programme configuration. Its sealed actual query reads the already-available inventory material through the existing factory; its value/trace and migrated decoder feed the original registered query-calculation raw/state/effect/inverse/whole/literal-next receipts. The original physical residual admission stock/target_next receipts are consumed independently, while actual macro next remains the original full-model/Shared.actual_next. No source factory, controller, carrier, payment aggregation or physical policy replacement is introduced.",
  "certified_machine_facts": [
    "The frozen Stock module and 20-mouth direct StockQuery gate independently pass fresh trust0/warningAsError. Required forced ABI/registered-raw/decoder control and core/pressure metadata gates also pass.",
    "Actual generic core is 541 local imports with zero domain imports. Direct gate graph is 749 and full inherited pressure union is 750. All 749 prior dependencies exactly match formal CP79 source/import/OLean/sidecar receipts; no dependency source was rebuilt.",
    "All 19 production declarations retain universe u. frameAt reads the same stock-configured sealed runtime; frame_actual/full_model_next identify its actual canonical full Frame and frameAt(stage+1), not a counter-reconstructed projection.",
    "sealed_query is the query actually emitted by runtime(initial,Inventory.programme lowcfg). source_query/source_value/source_trace consume that new configuration query; no previously emitted low continuous query is relabeled.",
    "The existing stock factory consumes frame.inventory and frame.pairInventory by actual priorSeed/priorPairInventory field matches. The low sourceRaw ignores both fields under structural replacement, as the explicit negative gate proves. No parallel reader/factory is reconstructed.",
    "registered_raw explicitly unfolds actionReader, programme and stock reader to the true stock query expression. registered_state/effect/inverse/whole/literal_next are original receipts for that registered query calculation.",
    "source_decoder and actor_decoder use existing decoder_preserved and the low result; the concrete native A decoder is a direct gate consumer, not a new generic source assumption. all_query_outputs and exact_query_charge retain the original migrated-data and charge mouths.",
    "same_ledger identifies the inherited original ledger. canonical_stock/canonical_next consume the original residual admission TargetAt/target_next and old source-stock coface receipt independently of the registered query calculation.",
    "The required additional forced gate normalizes Inventory.programme.calculationReader=None, unfolds the actual registered stock raw expression, and applies migrated decoder to the actual stock-runtime frame. This guards the exact stale-constructor interface failure.",
    "The formal private Installation artifact remains the correct 1995d13a...0b5fbb client; the parent-stage stale 2421b4b3...fa2e1 artifact is excluded. The formal CP79 integration review is bound, with no source/signature change.",
    "All 20 printed key mouths depend only on propext, Classical.choice and Quot.sound. The 56,492-declaration closure of the 24 selected production/direct-consumer roots has no unresolved dependency."
  ],
